---
import Base from '../../../layouts/Base.astro';
import '../../../styles/animals.css';
import '../../../styles/usluge.css';
import '../../../styles/oprema.css';
import { translationsFor } from '../../../i18n/routes';

const schema = [
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Article",
    "headline": "Ball python - Complete breeding and care guide",
    "description": "Everything you need to know about the ball python: diet, terrarium, temperature, health and breeding.",
    "author": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "NS Reptiles",
      "url": "https://nsreptiles.net"
    },
    "publisher": {
      "@type": "Organization",
      "name": "NS Reptiles",
      "logo": {
        "@type": "ImageObject",
        "url": "https://nsreptiles.net/style/img/logo.jpg"
      }
    },
    "mainEntityOfPage": {
      "@type": "WebPage",
      "@id": "https://nsreptiles.net/en/animals/ball-python.html"
    },
    "image": "https://nsreptiles.net/style/img/gallery/5.jpg"
  },
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
    "itemListElement": [
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 1,
        "name": "Home",
        "item": "https://nsreptiles.net/en/"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 2,
        "name": "Animals",
        "item": "https://nsreptiles.net/en/animals.html"
      },
      {
        "@type": "ListItem",
        "position": 3,
        "name": "Ball python",
        "item": "https://nsreptiles.net/en/animals/ball-python.html"
      }
    ]
  }
];
---
<Base
  lang="en"
  title="Ball Python — Breeding and Care Guide | NS Reptiles"
  description="Ball python guide: terrarium, diet, temperature and care. A calm snake that is ideal for beginners. Expert advice from NS Reptiles in Novi Sad."
  keywords="ball python, ball python care, ball python for sale, ball python Serbia, ball python Novi Sad, ball python terrarium, ball python diet, ball python morphs, snake for beginners, NS Reptiles"
  path="/en/animals/ball-python.html"
  image="/style/img/gallery/5.jpg"
  ogType="article"
  ogDescription="Ball python guide: terrarium, diet, temperature and care. A calm snake that is ideal for beginners. NS Reptiles, Novi Sad."
  active="animals"
  translations={translationsFor("/en/animals/ball-python.html")}
  schema={schema}
>
<section class="page-head">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h1>Ball python</h1>
        <p>One of the most popular snakes in the hobby — calm, docile and ideal for beginners. Available in a wide range of colors and patterned morphs.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="pd-crumbs">
      <div class="wrap">
        <nav class="pd-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/en/">Home</a>
          <span class="sep">›</span>
          <a href="/en/animals.html">Animals</a>
          <span class="sep">›</span>
          <span class="cur" aria-current="page">Ball python</span>
        </nav>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="animal-photo" style="background: var(--bg); padding: 24px 0 0; line-height: 0;">
      <div class="wrap">
        <img src="/style/img/gallery/5.jpg" alt="Ball python in a terrarium — NS Reptiles Novi Sad" loading="eager" width="1248" height="832" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; max-height: 520px; object-fit: cover;">
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="intro">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="intro-box reveal">
          <p>The ball python is one of the most popular snakes in the hobby because of its calm nature and the many morphs available. Calm and docile, they get used to handling easily and rarely show aggression — they are suitable for beginners. Thanks to selective breeding, they are available in a wide range of colors and patterns.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="zoo" style="padding-top: 40px;">
      <div class="wrap">

        <!-- Origin and habitat -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Origin and <b>habitat</b></h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Origin</h3>
            <p>West and Central Africa — the savannas and forest edges of Ghana, Nigeria, Cameroon and neighboring countries.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Habitat</h3>
            <p>Dry areas with vegetation, often near waterways. During the day they hide in burrows or under rocks, and they are active at dusk and at night.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Appearance and behavior -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Appearance and <b>behavior</b></h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Size and appearance</h3>
            <p>Length: 120–150 cm. A wide range of colors and patterns thanks to selective breeding. Slender body, head slightly wider than the neck, belly with distinctive markings.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Behavior</h3>
            <p>Mostly active at night, but they can also be active during the day. Calm and docile, they get used to handling easily. They rarely show aggression.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Terrarium and substrate -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Terrarium and <b>substrate</b></h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Terrarium</h3>
            <p>Minimum size for an adult: 90×45×45 cm. Provide hides, branches for climbing and a water bowl. The lid must be secure — they are known escape artists.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Substrate</h3>
            <p>Recommended substrates: peat, coco fiber, unprinted paper. Avoid fine particles that can cause impaction. Change the substrate regularly.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Temperature and conditions -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Temperature and <b>conditions</b></h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Temperature</h3>
            <p>Warm side: 28–30 °C. Cooler side: 22–24 °C. The nighttime temperature must not drop below 20 °C. Heating: heat mats or heat cables with a thermostat.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Lighting</h3>
            <p>UVB lighting is not necessary, but daylight is beneficial. Maintain a natural day and night cycle.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Humidity</h3>
            <p>Optimal humidity: 50–60 %. Increase humidity during shedding. Provide a humid hide or a box with moist substrate.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Water</h3>
            <p>Fresh water always available in a bowl large enough for bathing. Clean the bowl regularly to prevent contamination.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Diet and health -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Diet and <b>health</b></h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box" style="margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Diet</h3>
            <p>Babies: newborn mice (pinkies) every 5–7 days. Adults: adult mice or rats every 7–14 days. Offer prey of the right size — no wider than the narrowest part of the snake's body.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald Variable',sans-serif;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:1rem;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-soft);margin-bottom:8px;">Health</h3>
            <p>Common problems: metabolic bone disease, stuck shed, impaction, respiratory infections. Prevention: a proper diet, the right humidity and temperature, regular cleaning. If health problems occur, consult a vet who specializes in exotic animals.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Breeding -->
        <div class="cat-block reveal">
          <div class="cat-title">
            <h2>Breeding</h2>
            <div class="line"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-box">
            <p>Sexual maturity: 2–3 years. Females lay 4–10 eggs per clutch. Incubation: 55–60 days at a temperature of 30–32 °C.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>
<section class="pd-related section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="sec-head reveal">
          <h2 class="sec-title">Recommended products</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="op-grid">
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-100x40x40.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/100x40x40-2.webp" alt="Terrarium 100x40x40" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terrarium</div>
              <h3><a href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-100x40x40.html">Terrarium 100x40x40</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Price on request</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-100x50x50.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/100x50x50.webp" alt="Terrarium 100x50x50" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terrarium</div>
              <h3><a href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-100x50x50.html">Terrarium 100x50x50</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Price on request</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-90x50x50.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/90x50x50.webp" alt="Terrarium 90x50x50" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terrarium</div>
              <h3><a href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-90x50x50.html">Terrarium 90x50x50</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Price on request</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="op-card reveal">
            <a class="op-img" href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-80x50x50.html">
              <img src="/style/img/terrariums/80x50x50.webp" alt="Terrarium 80x50x50" loading="lazy" width="600" height="600">
            </a>
            <div class="op-body">
              <div class="op-cat">Terrarium</div>
              <h3><a href="/en/products/terrariums/terrarium-80x50x50.html">Terrarium 80x50x50</a></h3>
              <div class="op-foot">
                <span class="op-price">Price on request</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
<section class="zcta">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Contact <b>NS Reptiles</b></h2>
        <p>For questions about getting a ball python, its care or equipment — we are here. Give us a call or send a message.</p>
        <div class="zcta-btns">
          <a href="https://wa.me/381693301474?text=I%27m%20interested%20in%20a%20ball%20python" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn" style="background:#fff;color:var(--green-dark)" onclick="gtag('event','kontakt_click',{'metod':'whatsapp'})">WhatsApp</a>
          <a href="tel:+381693301474" class="btn btn-light" onclick="gtag('event','kontakt_click',{'metod':'poziv'})">+381 69 330 1474</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


</Base>
